---
title: Cherry Salad
author: Marge Arntson
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@crushed pineapple{1%med drained can}
@miniature marshmallows{1%c}
@chopped nuts{1/2%c}
@cherry pie filling{1%can}
@diced bananas{2}
@whipped cream{1/2%pt}

Mix all together and refrigerate until served.
